@startuml class_diagram_parte1
!pragma layout smetana
title Dominio e persistenza - proprieta' scalari
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty methods
class User {
  Id : int
  Email : string
  PasswordHash : string
  Role : UserRole
  CreatedAt : DateTime
  IsActive : bool
}
class Issue {
  Id : int
  Title : string
  Description : string
  Type : IssueType
  Priority : IssuePriority?
  Status : IssueStatus
  CreatedById : int
  AssignedToId : int?
  DuplicateOfIssueId : int?
  ImagePath : string?
  IsArchived : bool
  CreatedAt : DateTime
  UpdatedAt : DateTime
  ResolvedAt : DateTime?
}
class Notification {
  Id : int
  UserId : int
  IssueId : int
  Message : string
  IsRead : bool
  CreatedAt : DateTime
}
class ApplicationDbContext {
  Users : DbSet<User>
  Issues : DbSet<Issue>
  Notifications : DbSet<Notification>
  # OnModelCreating(modelBuilder)
}
User "1" -- "0..*" Issue : CreatedBy / CreatedIssues
User "0..1" -- "0..*" Issue : AssignedTo / AssignedIssues
Issue "0..*" --> "0..1" Issue : DuplicateOfIssue
User "1" -- "0..*" Notification : User / Notifications
Issue "1" -- "0..*" Notification : Issue / Notifications
ApplicationDbContext ..> User
ApplicationDbContext ..> Issue
ApplicationDbContext ..> Notification
legend bottom
  Eredita da DbContext. ? indica nullabilita'.
  Enum: UserRole
  (Admin, User, Readonly);
  IssueType (Question, Bug,
  Documentation, Feature);
  IssuePriority (Low, Medium,
  High, Critical);
  IssueStatus (Todo, InProgress,
  Resolved, Closed, Duplicate).
endlegend
@enduml

@startuml class_diagram_parte2
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
title Controller e dipendenze reali
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
class AuthController {
  + Login(request)
}
class UsersController {
  + GetUsers()
  + CreateUser(request)
}
class IssuesController {
  + Create(...)
  + GetAll(...)
  + GetById(...)
  + UpdateStatus(...)
  + Archive(...)
  + MarkAsDuplicate(...)
  + GetArchived(...)
  + SuggestAssignee(...)
  + Export(...)
  + UploadImage(...)
  + GetImage(...)
}
class NotificationsController {
  + GetAll(cancellationToken)
  + MarkAsRead(id, cancellationToken)
}
class HealthController {
  + Get()
}
class ApplicationDbContext
class IssueDomainService {
  + SearchIssues(issues, keyword)
  + CanChangeIssueStatus(user, issue)
  + SuggestAssignee(users, issues)
}
interface IPasswordHasher {
  + Hash(password)
  + Verify(password, passwordHash)
}
class Pbkdf2PasswordHasher
interface IJwtTokenService {
  + CreateToken(user)
}
class JwtTokenService
class IssueImageStorage {
  + ValidateAsync(...)
  + SaveAsync(...)
  + OpenRead(name)
  + Delete(name)
  + GetContentType(name)
}
AuthController --> ApplicationDbContext
UsersController --> ApplicationDbContext
IssuesController --> ApplicationDbContext
NotificationsController --> ApplicationDbContext
IssuesController --> IssueDomainService
IssuesController --> IssueImageStorage
AuthController --> IPasswordHasher
UsersController --> IPasswordHasher
AuthController --> IJwtTokenService
Pbkdf2PasswordHasher ..|> IPasswordHasher
JwtTokenService ..|> IJwtTokenService
legend bottom
  Operazioni elencate per nome; firme abbreviate con (...).
  DTO e dipendenze di framework omessi per leggibilita':
  ILogger<IssuesController>, IConfiguration, IWebHostEnvironment.
  I controller ereditano da ControllerBase; nessun repository.
endlegend
@enduml

